{
  "answer_text": "The method achieving the highest factual accuracy (or lowest hallucination rate, depending on the metric definition) within each paper is as follows:\n\n*   **S001:** Chain-of-thought prompting (9.4% hallucination rate) [S001, 2088-2166].\n*   **S002:** The variant that reformulates the question before the search (78.1% factually correct) [S002, 2406-2541].\n*   **S003:** The parametric-only model (78.3% fact-level accuracy) [S003, 3089-3145].\n*   **S004:** The parametric-only model (59.8% answer accuracy on LawFactQA; the retrieve-then-read model is 0.9 points lower) [S004, 2568-2901, 3015-3143].\n*   **S005:** The retrieval-augmented model (53.8% answer accuracy) [S005, 2582-2751].\n*   **S006:** The fine-tuned model (9.8% hallucination rate) [S006, 2328-2399].\n*   **S007:** The generator adapted to the domain by further training (18.2% unsupported statements) [S007, 3021-3172].\n*   **S008:** The retrieval-augmented generator (6.3% hallucination rate) [S008, 2598-2656].\n*   **S009:** The parametric-only model (53.8% fact-level accuracy on NewsTruthQA; 49.9% on LawFactQA) [S009, 2474-2750].\n*   **S010:** RAG without reranking (23.1% hallucination rate) [S010, 2143-2285].\n*   **S011:** Chain-of-thought prompting (71.8% fact-level accuracy) [S011, 2253-2335].\n*   **S012:** The model that answers from its own parameters (19.3% unsupported statements) [S012, 2463-2606].\n*   **S013:** The vanilla LLM (47.5% answer accuracy) [S013, 3173-3242].\n*   **S014:** The closed-book model (60.6% answer accuracy on BioClaimQA; 38.9% on TriviaCheck) [S014, 1788-2126].\n*   **S015:** The fine-tuned model (69.8% answer accuracy) [S015, 2610-2777].\n*   **S016:** The retrieval-augmented generator (5.1% hallucination frequency) [S016, 2391-2484].\n*   **S017:** The model that samples several answers and votes (19.1% invented facts) [S017, 2809-2943].\n*   **S018:** The retrieve-then-read model (16.3% hallucination rate) [S018, 2705-2760].\n*   **S019:** The no-retrieval baseline (64.2% fact-level accuracy on TriviaCheck; 49.5% on HistoryQuest) [S019, 2114-2579].\n*   **S020:** The retrieval-augmented model (64.6% answer accuracy) [S020, 2556-2737].",
